  "scope": "Immediate JVM dispatcher host. Complete original Float/Dp/Color animate-as-state wrappers, animateValueAsState and AnimateAsState class/tooling interface; original ColorVectorConverter and Float/Dp converters; native Animatable, TargetBasedAnimation, AnimationState, SuspendAnimation, animation-core mutex and finite spring/snap bodies with real coroutine Jobs/Mutex. Remember slots/commit, plain scalar State, JVM dispatcher/frame/delay and Float Oklab Color/space identity are explicit hosts. No Compose snapshot scheduler, native packed Color/space conversion, Android OS event loop, component recomposition/focus/IME, font or raster."
